# Skills installed by `skills add` are reproducible from skills-lock.json — do not vendor
# them. Whole dirs: the CLI writes a shared .agents/skills store plus per-agent symlinks,
# and nothing in there is useful to commit.
#
# The EmDash skills are the exception, and they are NOT in skills-lock.json: they ship with
# the site, and they are vendored into .github/skills/ (committed) so they exist on a fresh
# clone. Skills are discovered when a session STARTS, so a gitignored copy means an agent
# can begin work with no EmDash knowledge at all — which is exactly what happened. The
# .claude/skills/emdash copy below is still gitignored: it is generated from .src/.
/.agents/skills/
/.claude/skills/
.crush/
.goose/

# Exported from the live DB by `mise run seed:export` — derived, not source
/config/seed.live.json
